                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c23893d8-7931-4763-a61c-f61b587994a9",
                                "sense_id": "f7fa889f-1ce1-31c8-8020-405281b0a5b2",
                                "text": "Подойдя́ к коту́, он взял его́ за пере́дние ла́пы, подня́л и спря́тал его́ на груди́ под шу́бу, причём Фёдор Тимофе́ич каза́лся о́чень равноду́шным и да́же не потруди́лся откры́ть глаз.",
                                "translation": "Going over to the cat, he picked him up by the front paws and put him on his chest inside the fur coat, to which Fyodor Timofeyich seemed very indifferent and did not even bother opening his eyes.",
                                "english": "Going over to the cat, he picked him up by the front paws and put him on his chest inside the fur coat, to which Fyodor Timofeyich seemed very indifferent and did not even bother opening his eyes."
                            }
                        ]
